title: '<localleader>vu : :SkgToggleForkDedupOverlay'
pid: ec8850b4-690e-48a7-be8a-4350d5f314b9
body: |2-
  Toggles, in this buffer, the extmarks that say what a member of a
  forks folder restates of its note, as C-c v u does in Emacs:
  =<b unchanged>= over the title of a member whose title and body equal
  the note's, its body's lines concealed; =<b's title unchanged>= over a
  title alone equal to the note's; =<b's body unchanged>= over a body
  alone equal to it, its other lines concealed. They are on
  unless the buffer variable 'skg_fork_dedup_overlay' is false. The
  buffer always holds the real text, and a save sends it.
